{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110310001:2":{"text":"まさかブルータス様と戦うことになるなんて……アルサ？おい、アルサ？","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1110310001":{"text":"まさかブルータス様と戦うことになるなんて……アルサ？おい、アルサ？","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110310002:1":{"text":"お前、またいつもの現実逃避か？早く出てこい！","source_cn":"你这家伙又不肯面对现实了吗？给我出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C78EE3702A13351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110310003:1":{"text":"ひっぱらないでよぉっ！ソーンこそ本気なの？相手はあの戦神ブルータスなんだよ！？","source_cn":"别拽我别拽我！索恩，你是疯了吗？你是真的想挑战战神布鲁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0A6FAF538A7FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110310004:1":{"text":"あの大剣の威力を見たよね？百歩譲って命は見逃してくれるとしても、まともに動けない体になっちゃったら、誰がウールを守るの！？","source_cn":"你看到他那把大剑砍下来的力道了吧！即使他宽大为怀，留我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB98F15EAA0BF57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110310005:1":{"text":"どういう意味だ？まだ戦ってもないのに、もう負けたときの心配か？","source_cn":"你这是什么意思……还没开打，就想着输？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6293F1ACD0050AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110310006:1":{"text":"そっちこそどういう意味だよ！？もしかして本当に勝てると思ってるの！？","source_cn":"我还想问你是什么意思！你莫非觉得你有机会赢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EA01778BF79E2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110310007:1":{"text":"お前、棄権するつもりか？あの戦神と戦えるチャンスなのに？アルサ、まさか父ちゃんとの約束を忘れたのか？","source_cn":"所以，你想临阵脱逃？你想放弃和战神做对手的机会？阿尔萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6BD36BB9CC7BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110310008:1":{"text":"オレたちは父ちゃんから一族を託されたんだ。だからオレたちは砂漠の奴らにウール族を――","source_cn":"老爹将氏族托付给我们，所以，我们要向整片沙漠证明乌尔氏族——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5190993156D7AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110310009:1":{"text":"冷静になってよ！一族を存続させるのが僕たちの責任でしょ！","source_cn":"你给我清醒点好吗？我们要做的是让乌尔氏族活下来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307586D272E9CDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110310010:1":{"text":"これは、生きるための力なんだ！こんな負け戦、僕は絶対に行かないからね！","source_cn":"为了活下来，必须保存力量！这种必败的挑战，我绝不会去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6536FB3CA8FAB4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110310011:1":{"text":"弱虫め――","source_cn":"懦弱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037C65F271E69231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110310012:1":{"text":"ああ、僕は弱虫さ！でも自己中な君よりはマシだよ！後先考えない君よりはね！","source_cn":"对，我是懦弱，但也好过你自私！你只想要挑战，从不想后果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6818645C51561EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110310013:2":{"text":"戦いはいつだって未知数だ。必ず負る戦なんて存在しない。","source_cn":"战斗中，什么都可能发生，没有哪场战斗必定会输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52904F9AFE177FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110310014:1":{"text":"強き者は決して逃げない。アルサ……","source_cn":"强者不会逃避。到了约定之日，阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE6B27114877EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110310015:1":{"text":"お前は好きにすればいい。だがたとえ一人でも、オレは試練に挑む。",